se', 'content': {'batched_responses': [{'batch_start': 0, 'batch_end': 13, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0001.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0002.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0003.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0004.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0005.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0006.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0007.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0008.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0009.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0010.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0011.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0012.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0013.jpg'], 'response': 'Based on the 13 frames provided, here is a detailed analysis of the overall style and atmosphere of the video:\n\n---\n\n**1) Presence of Text Overlays/Titles:**\n\nThe video opens with a prominent, bold, white text overlay that reads “VLOG SPEND 2 DAYS WITH ME.” This text appears across multiple frames (Frames 1–7), serving as a clear title card that immediately establishes the format and intent of the video: a personal, immersive vlog. The text is simple, sans-serif, and centered, giving it a clean, modern, and accessible feel. It doesn’t distract from the visuals but reinforces the “come along with me” vibe.\n\n---\n\n**2) Setting and Environment:**\n\nThe setting is a clean, well-lit, contemporary bathroom with light blue walls, white marble countertops, and a large mirror. The space feels personal and lived-in — with skincare products, toothbrushes, and towels visible — but also organized and aesthetically pleasing. The presence of a glass shower stall and natural light from a window (Frame 11) adds to the sense of realism and comfort. The environment is not staged to be luxurious, but rather authentic and relatable — a “real person’s bathroom.”\n\n---\n\n**3) Person’s Demeanor and Actions:**\n\nThe man is calm, focused, and unhurried. He performs routine tasks — washing his face, rinsing a bowl, checking his phone — with a quiet, almost meditative rhythm. He doesn’t perform for the camera; instead, he seems to be going about his morning naturally, occasionally glancing at his reflection or phone. His demeanor is grounded and self-assured, contributing to the video’s intimate, “slice-of-life” feel. His casual black t-shirt and visible tattoos add to the authenticity — he’s not dressed up; he’s just being himself.\n\n---\n\n**4) Camera Work and Framing:**\n\nThe camera is mostly static, positioned to capture the mirror reflection and countertop area, creating a “fly-on-the-wall” perspective. This framing allows viewers to feel like they’re observing a private moment without intrusion. The shots are medium to close-up, focusing on actions (like washing his face or pouring water) and facial expressions (especially in the mirror). There’s no dramatic movement or rapid cuts — the pacing is steady and deliberate, matching the rhythm of a morning routine.\n\n---\n\n**5) Overall Mood/Vibe:**\n\nThe overall mood is **realistic, calm, and relaxing**. It’s not romantic or exciting — it’s grounded in the quiet intimacy of daily life. The video invites viewers into a personal, unfiltered moment, making it feel like a digital companion joining you for your morning. The combination of the soft lighting, the gentle actions, and the unpretentious setting creates a soothing, almost ASMR-like atmosphere. It’s the kind of video you might watch while sipping coffee or winding down — not for adrenaline, but for connection and comfort.\n\n---\n\n**Final Summary:**\n\n> **Style:** Casual, documentary-style vlog with clean text overlays and static, observational framing.  \n> **Atmosphere:** Realistic, intimate, and relaxing — like a quiet morning shared with a friend.  \n> **Vibe:** Calm, authentic, and personal — designed to make the viewer feel present in the moment, not entertained by spectacle.\n\nThis is a **relaxing, realistic vlog** that prioritizes authenticity over production polish, creating a comforting, everyday atmosphere that many viewers would find relatable and soothing.'}], 'formatted_responses': ['\n=== Batch 0-13 (13 frames) ===\nFrames: /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0001.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0002.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0003.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0004.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0005.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0006.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0007.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0008.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0009.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0010.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0011.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0012.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0013.jpg\nVLM Response: Based on the 13 frames provided, here is a detailed analysis of the overall style and atmosphere of the video:\n\n---\n\n**1) Presence of Text Overlays/Titles:**\n\nThe video opens with a prominent, bold, white text overlay that reads “VLOG SPEND 2 DAYS WITH ME.” This text appears across multiple frames (Frames 1–7), serving as a clear title card that immediately establishes the format and intent of the video: a personal, immersive vlog. The text is simple, sans-serif, and centered, giving it a clean, modern, and accessible feel. It doesn’t distract from the visuals but reinforces the “come along with me” vibe.\n\n---\n\n**2) Setting and Environment:**\n\nThe setting is a clean, well-lit, contemporary bathroom with light blue walls, white marble countertops, and a large mirror. The space feels personal and lived-in — with skincare products, toothbrushes, and towels visible — but also organized and aesthetically pleasing. The presence of a glass shower stall and natural light from a window (Frame 11) adds to the sense of realism and comfort. The environment is not staged to be luxurious, but rather authentic and relatable — a “real person’s bathroom.”\n\n---\n\n**3) Person’s Demeanor and Actions:**\n\nThe man is calm, focused, and unhurried. He performs routine tasks — washing his face, rinsing a bowl, checking his phone — with a quiet, almost meditative rhythm. He doesn’t perform for the camera; instead, he seems to be going about his morning naturally, occasionally glancing at his reflection or phone. His demeanor is grounded and self-assured, contributing to the video’s intimate, “slice-of-life” feel. His casual black t-shirt and visible tattoos add to the authenticity — he’s not dressed up; he’s just being himself.\n\n---\n\n**4) Camera Work and Framing:**\n\nThe camera is mostly static, positioned to capture the mirror reflection and countertop area, creating a “fly-on-the-wall” perspective. This framing allows viewers to feel like they’re observing a private moment without intrusion. The shots are medium to close-up, focusing on actions (like washing his face or pouring water) and facial expressions (especially in the mirror). There’s no dramatic movement or rapid cuts — the pacing is steady and deliberate, matching the rhythm of a morning routine.\n\n---\n\n**5) Overall Mood/Vibe:**\n\nThe overall mood is **realistic, calm, and relaxing**. It’s not romantic or exciting — it’s grounded in the quiet intimacy of daily life. The video invites viewers into a personal, unfiltered moment, making it feel like a digital companion joining you for your morning. The combination of the soft lighting, the gentle actions, and the unpretentious setting creates a soothing, almost ASMR-like atmosphere. It’s the kind of video you might watch while sipping coffee or winding down — not for adrenaline, but for connection and comfort.\n\n---\n\n**Final Summary:**\n\n> **Style:** Casual, documentary-style vlog with clean text overlays and static, observational framing.  \n> **Atmosphere:** Realistic, intimate, and relaxing — like a quiet morning shared with a friend.  \n> **Vibe:** Calm, authentic, and personal — designed to make the viewer feel present in the moment, not entertained by spectacle.\n\nThis is a **relaxing, realistic vlog** that prioritizes authenticity over production polish, creating a comforting, everyday atmosphere that many viewers would find relatable and soothing.\n'], 'condensed_response': '**Condensed Scene Summary (Frames\u202f1‑13)**  \n\n- **Frames\u202f1‑7 – Opening title:** A bold white text overlay (“VLOG\u202fSPEND\u202f2\u202fDAYS\u202fWITH\u202fME”) appears centered on the screen, establishing the vlog’s personal‑invite tone.  \n\n- **Frames\u202f1‑3 – Entrance & setting:** The camera, fixed in front of a large mirror, shows a clean, well‑lit bathroom (light‑blue walls, white marble countertop, glass‑door shower). Personal items—skincare bottles, toothbrush, towels—create a lived‑in, relatable ambience.  \n\n- **Frames\u202f4‑6 – First action (face wash):** The man, wearing a casual black tee and visible tattoos, turns toward the sink, splashes water on his face and rubs a cleanser. His movements are slow and deliberate; he glances briefly at his reflection, conveying a calm, meditative routine.  \n\n- **Frames\u202f7‑9 – Secondary action (bowl rinse):** He picks up a small bowl, fills it under the tap, and rinses it, then places it back on the counter. The static framing captures his hands and the subtle steam from the nearby shower, reinforcing the intimate, “fly‑on‑the‑wall” feel.  \n\n- **Frames\u202f10‑11 – Distraction (phone):** He pauses, checks his phone held up to the mirror, then puts it down. The brief phone glance adds a modern, everyday touch without breaking the relaxed pacing.  \n\n- **Frames\u202f12‑13 – Closing visual:** Natural light streams from a window, highlighting the sleek surfaces and reinforcing the soothing, realistic vibe of the morning routine.  \n\n**Character tracking:** Throughout the 13‑frame clip the same individual remains the focal point, proceeding through a simple sequence—title overlay → bathroom entry → face wash → bowl rinse → phone check → quiet pause—each action captured with medium‑close shots that keep the mirror reflection in view. The static camera and soft lighting give the scene a documentary‑style, intimate atmosphere, inviting the viewer to share a calm, everyday moment.', 'failed_images': []}}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'Based on the VLM analysis of frames 1-13, I can determine the overall style of the video. The VLM clearly describes the style as "casual, documentary-style vlog" with a "realistic, intimate, and relaxing" atmosphere. The mood is described as "realistic, calm, and relaxing" rather than romantic or exciting.\n\nLet me record these observations and then provide the final answer:\n\n```json\n{\n    "tool": "RECORD",\n    "entries": [\n        "Time: 1-7 seconds, Event: Prominent text overlay \'VLOG SPEND 2 DAYS WITH ME\' establishes vlog format",\n        "Time: 1-13 seconds, Event: Casual, documentary-style vlog with static observational framing",\n        "Time: 1-13 seconds, Event: Realistic, intimate, and relaxing atmosphere",\n        "Time: 1-13 seconds, Event: Calm, authentic, personal vibe prioritizing authenticity over production polish"\n    ]\n}\n```'}, {'role': 'system', 'content': 'Successfully recorded 4 even