dence better than relaxing, romantic, or exciting styles."\n}'}, {'role': 'vlm response', 'content': {'batched_responses': [{'batch_start': 0, 'batch_end': 19, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0001.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0002.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0003.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0004.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0005.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0006.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0007.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0008.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0009.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0010.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0011.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0012.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/1FsiZgGZU70/frames/frame_0013.jpg'], 'response': 'The video frames strongly support the classification of **2 = Realistic**.\n\nHere’s the verification based on the six criteria:\n\n---\n\n**1) Is there vlog-style title/introduction text?**  \n✅ **Yes.** Frame 2 shows “VLOG SPEND 2 DAYS WITH ME” overlaid on the screen. This is a classic vlog title card, immediately signaling a personal, documentary-style format.\n\n---\n\n**2) Is the setting casual/intimate (bathroom/personal space)?**  \n✅ **Yes.** All frames take place in a bathroom — a highly personal, private space. The presence of toiletries, a mirror, and a sink reinforces the intimate, everyday setting typical of realistic vlogs.\n\n---\n\n**3) Are facial expressions and movements calm/relaxed?**  \n✅ **Yes.** The man’s movements are unhurried — washing his face, rinsing, and later checking his phone. H